
---
import Layout from "../Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | MakautNetwork"
  description="Read how MakautNetwork handles information when you use its website and academic tools."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#071426] lg:px-4 lg:py-2 text-white px-6 py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-400">
        Legal
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-400">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>

      <p class="mt-6 leading-7 text-slate-300">
        This policy explains how MakautNetwork handles information when you visit
        and use our website. We aim to collect only what is needed to operate,
        maintain, and improve the service.
      </p>

      <section class="mt-9">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Information you provide</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          If you contact us by email, we receive the information you choose to
          include, such as your email address and message. We use it to respond to
          your enquiry and address the issue you raise.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Do not send passwords, identity documents, student credentials, or other
          sensitive information unless it is genuinely necessary for your enquiry.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Calculator inputs</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          The academic calculators on this website are designed to calculate
          results from the values you enter. Do not enter personal information
          into a calculator field. If a tool is changed to store or send input
          data, its handling will depend on the feature and the applicable
          privacy notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Technical information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          When you visit a website, its hosting and security services may process
          technical information such as your IP address, browser type, requested
          pages, and request timestamps. This information may be used to deliver
          the site, diagnose errors, prevent abuse, and maintain security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          The website or its hosting and third-party services may use cookies or
          similar technologies for essential functionality, security, analytics,
          or other enabled features. The technologies used depend on the services
          actually configured on the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Third-party services and links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Some pages may link to external websites or services. When you follow
          those links, the other service's privacy policy and practices apply.
          We do not control how third parties collect or use information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. How information is used</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Information may be used to respond to messages, maintain website
          security, troubleshoot problems, and improve the website. We do not
          intend to sell personal information submitted directly to us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Data retention and security</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Information is retained for as long as reasonably needed for its
          purpose, to address enquiries, meet applicable legal obligations, or
          maintain security. We take reasonable steps to protect information, but
          no online service can guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          This website is intended for students and general visitors. We do not
          knowingly seek to collect personal information from children when it
          is not necessary to provide the service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          We may update this policy when the website's features or practices
          change. The revised version will be published on this page with an
          updated date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-9 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0d1e33] p-5">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Questions about privacy?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Contact us if you have a question about this policy or information you
          have sent to us.
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@makaut.net"
          class="mt-3 inline-block font-medium text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200"
        >
          contact@makaut.net
        </a>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
